### Physics validation

Test at least these cases:

Case 1:
V = 12 V, R = 4 Ω
Expected current = 3 A.

Case 2:
Two resistors of 2 Ω and 4 Ω in series.
Expected equivalent resistance = 6 Ω.

Case 3:
Two resistors of 6 Ω and 6 Ω in parallel.
Expected equivalent resistance = 3 Ω.

Case 4:
V = 12 V, I = 2 A.
Expected power = 24 W.

Do not declare completion until the calculations and workflows pass.

